      "id": "4qrbsgz",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Lengthiest Written Constitution"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The Indian Constitution is the lengthiest written constitution in the world, synthesized from various global sources.",
        "It establishes a unique constitutional framework with a federal system containing strong unitary features.",
        "It adopts a Parliamentary form of government at both the Centre and the States.",
        "Key provisions include Fundamental Rights, Directive Principles of State Policy, and Emergency Provisions.",
        "It guarantees an Independent Judiciary, Single Citizenship, Secular State principles, and Universal Adult Franchise."
      ],
      "id": "agl7lz0"
    },
